# Stack

- React 18, TypeScript (strict), Vite, Supabase (`src/lib/supabase.ts`, `src/services/dataService.ts`)
- Tests: Vitest (`*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`), E2E: Playwright (`e2e/`)
- Icons: `lucide-react`

# Layout

- Feature modules: `src/modules/<Name>/`
- Shared UI: `src/components/ui/` — extend these before adding one-off styles
- Hooks: `src/hooks/`, types: `src/types/`, utils: `src/utils/`
- Lazy routes: use `lazyWithRetry` from `src/utils/lazyWithRetry.ts`

# Code style

- Match existing patterns in the file you edit (default exports, inline Tailwind `className` strings, Thai copy via `t()` / `src/utils/i18n.ts` where the module already uses i18n)
- Prefer focused changes; do not relax ESLint rules or widen `any` usage to silence errors
- Data access goes through existing services; avoid duplicating Supabase queries in components
- New behavior: add or update Vitest tests when the area already has test files
